{
  "id": "22661_kito",
  "headword": "{企図|きと}",
  "reading": "きと",
  "romaji": "kito",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "plan; scheme; attempt",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "plan; scheme; attempt; design",
      "explanation": "A deliberate plan or attempt to accomplish something, often implying calculated intention. Used in formal contexts and frequently carries a negative nuance when describing someone else's plans."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "22661_kito_ex1",
      "japanese": "クーデターを{企図|きと}する。",
      "english": "To plan a coup d'état.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "22661_kito_ex2",
      "japanese": "{犯人|はんにん}は{逃亡|とうぼう}を{企図|きと}していたようだ。",
      "english": "It seems the criminal was planning to escape.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "22661_kito_ex3",
      "japanese": "この{政策|せいさく}は{経済|けいざい}{成長|せいちょう}と{環境|かんきょう}{保護|ほご}の{両立|りょうりつ}を{企図|きと}したものだ。",
      "english": "This policy was designed to achieve both economic growth and environmental protection.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A compound of {企|き} (plan/scheme) and {図|と} (diagram/plan). A formal, somewhat literary word for planning or scheming. Often appears in news reporting, legal contexts, and academic writing.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {企図|きと}する: to plan, to attempt\n- {犯行|はんこう}を{企図|きと}する: to plan a crime\n- {自殺|じさつ}を{企図|きと}する: to attempt suicide (medical/clinical term)\n- {改革|かいかく}を{企図|きと}する: to design a reform\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {計画|けいかく}: plan — neutral and everyday; lacks the calculated/scheming nuance\n- {策謀|さくぼう}: plot, intrigue — more strongly negative, implies deception\n- {企|たくら}む: to scheme — a verb with similar meaning but more colloquial and always negative\n- {意図|いと}: intention — focuses on the intent itself rather than the planning action",
  "schema_version": "2.0",
